    "detailed_description": "<strong>Quest to progress</strong><br>Progress your character in a world filled with quests and activities, such as group dungeons and world bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/666d266b20ad01ff41dc30c692731c88.poster.avif?t=1749072006\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/666d266b20ad01ff41dc30c692731c88.webm?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/666d266b20ad01ff41dc30c692731c88.mp4?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Loots</strong><br>Chase the perfect loots with creatures that have rich loot tables and equipment that can roll random stats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/c846b64b915196f18407440c74b4fec0.poster.avif?t=1749072006\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/c846b64b915196f18407440c74b4fec0.webm?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/c846b64b915196f18407440c74b4fec0.mp4?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Craft</strong><br>Countless crafting station scattered across the world, some with unique recipes not available elsewhere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/7280f9c4608e22feeb2de7878eee2e84.poster.avif?t=1749072006\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/7280f9c4608e22feeb2de7878eee2e84.webm?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/7280f9c4608e22feeb2de7878eee2e84.mp4?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Skills and Talents</strong><br>Shape your character your way with an extensive talent system and a vast variety of ability to choose from.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/1722ac6333966eb209f46cff6cb24337.poster.avif?t=1749072006\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/1722ac6333966eb209f46cff6cb24337.webm?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/1722ac6333966eb209f46cff6cb24337.mp4?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Land plots and traders</strong><br>Own a pieces of land in the game world and build a house on it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6727086c8233d40f05d71f2a92fb7ee4.poster.avif?t=1749072006\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6727086c8233d40f05d71f2a92fb7ee4.webm?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6727086c8233d40f05d71f2a92fb7ee4.mp4?t=1749072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Load your trader with goods that other players visiting your land can buy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl